00:03:26.161 --> 00:03:27.529
to the constitution to devote

00:03:27.796 --> 00:03:28.663
themselves completely to this

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.798
flawed human being.

00:03:30.165 --> 00:03:31.699
&gt;&gt; You are a former federal

00:03:32.167 --> 00:03:33.768
prosecutor out in Florida.

00:03:34.602 --> 00:03:35.770
Should the U.S. Department

00:03:36.171 --> 00:03:37.672
asked judge Aileen cannon to

00:03:38.173 --> 00:03:38.640
recuse herself from this case?

00:03:40.175 --> 00:03:43.044
&gt;&gt; I don't think there's a

00:03:43.311 --> 00:03:44.179
basis for the justice

00:03:44.446 --> 00:03:46.181
department to ask her to recuse

00:03:46.281 --> 00:03:47.048
herself based on her

00:03:48.183 --> 00:03:49.017
