00:03:56.891 --> 00:03:58.860
I am concerned with her

00:03:59.127 --> 00:04:00.195
impartiality, not because she

00:04:00.261 --> 00:04:02.197
was overturned and not because

00:04:02.363 --> 00:04:04.199
