00:04:13.141 --> 00:04:15.143
that to me, it does potentially

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.880
betray a real bias here and

00:04:19.147 --> 00:04:20.215
what caused her judgment to

00:04:20.315 --> 00:04:21.116
call into question.

00:04:21.382 --> 00:04:23.118
So I do have serious concerns

00:04:23.384 --> 00:04:24.219
about her but I don't think

00:04:24.319 --> 00:04:26.221
